rovement in AR collection times</p></div></div><p class="more"><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/about' ) ); ?>">More on how we work →</a></p></div></section><section class="cta"><div class="wrap"><h2>Bring us one workflow.</h2><p>Thirty minutes, no deck. Pick the process that costs you most in people, errors or delay, and we'll pressure-test whether an agent is genuinely the right answer for it.</p><ul class="cta-list"><li>An honest read on whether that workflow is a good agent candidate</li><li>What the first deployment would involve, and roughly what it costs</li><li>An honest answer if the sequencing is wrong and you should fix something else first</li></ul><a class="btn btn-lg" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/contact' ) ); ?>">Book a discovery call</a></div></section>
